// The app's Shopify settings. Copy this file to Secrets.xcconfig in this same folder and fill it in there.
// Secrets.xcconfig is git-ignored: it stays on this Mac and is never committed. Paste the values yourself;
// never paste them into a chat.
//
// Where they are: Shopify admin › Sales channels › Headless › your storefront › Storefront API
// (step 7 of docs/shopify-setup.md in the website repo). Use the PUBLIC access token, never the private one.
//
// Write the store address without "https://": an .xcconfig file reads "//" as the start of a comment.

SHOPIFY_STORE_DOMAIN =
SHOPIFY_STOREFRONT_TOKEN =
